{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在上半屏左侧的大号白色正文，字号最大、亮度和对比度最强；其次才可能注意右侧彩色小目录，下方金色音符动画主要提供视觉动感。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"高兴之后仍想确认对方以后不会变，越喜欢和对方相处，越担心这种美好能不能一直持续。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"喜欢、幸福、期待，同时有隐约的不安和害怕失去。\",\n  \"missed\": \"更深一层是害怕对方有一天不再需要自己，想隐藏心意却又舍不得，幸福逐渐掺入悲伤和失落。这些需要继续读后面的正文才能完整理解。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"单块正文较长，同一字号连续铺开，包含期待承诺、害怕失去、隐藏心意、幸福掺入悲伤等多层意思。\",\n    \"核心处境和感受集中在开头，但后续情绪变化需要继续阅读才能理解。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ff1d8dd6-5f24-4dae-a758-225b2ccd91aa", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T014516715577Z", "elapsed_seconds": 71.468, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:46:28.188580+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "636ada5eb7c53255a50a062b56844cd9a4991374956b8c02774bc3ae44b01f4f", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt